# Admin Ant Design `Table` (어댑터)

**공통 스펙:** [cms-data-table.mdc](../../../../.cursor/rules/cms-admin-ui/cms-data-table.mdc) · [table-th.mdc](../../../../.cursor/rules/cms-admin-ui/table-th.mdc)

## Admin path

| 항목 | 경로 |
|------|------|
| CSS | `apps/admin/src/shared/ui/cms-data-table.css` |
| 상수 | `apps/admin/src/shared/constants/table.ts` (`TABLE_COLUMN_WIDTHS`, `CMS_TABLE_NO_COL_CLASS`, disabled class) |

## Admin 관례

- No. 열: `width: TABLE_COLUMN_WIDTHS.index` (80), `className: CMS_TABLE_NO_COL_CLASS`
- 선택: `TABLE_COLUMN_WIDTHS.checkbox` (68)
- 첫 열이 No.가 아니면 `cms-data-table--skip-auto-no-col`
- 필터: 조회 커밋 ([list-filter-url-sync](../../../../.cursor/rules/cms-admin-ui/list-filter-url-sync.mdc))
- **Don’t** `apps/cms/...` import

## 스택 차이

| | CMS | Admin |
|--|-----|-------|
| 목록 셸 | `FilterTableLayout` + `useTablePage` | `admin-list-card` + `useListFilterUrl` |

